			"Message": "build(Maintain): Formatting pass across codegen and format tooling\n\nUpdate the Element submodule and apply consistent formatting to Maintain/Codegen and Maintain/Format scripts. The Element submodule advance includes a comprehensive formatting pass across Cache, Cocoon, Grove, Mist, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, and Vine with Sky's build pipeline hardened (modular bridge handler installers, brotli compression, extension manifest scanning).\n\nMaintain/Codegen/ResolveIdentity.ts and Sync.ts receive blank-line formatting to match project conventions. Maintain/Format.sh is restructured to add a new dos2unix line-endings normalization step, splits TypeScript formatting into FormatTypeScript.py, and mirrors the Rust/TypeScript blank-line formatter pattern. Format/Rust.py and Format/TypeScript.py are modernized with PascalCase variable names, TypedDict for scan results, and refined path exclusion logic.\n\ntailwind.config.js receives consistent blank-line formatting in content paths and plugins array. All changes are cosmetic or build-improvement focused with no functional behavior changes except Sky's enhanced build pipeline.\n\nThis is a batch formatting update that syncs automated tooling outputs and applies the established blank-line convention across the codebase.",
