			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Clean up dead code in five elements\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to 75959ba1, which incorporates two commits advancing Air, Cocoon, Grove, Mountain, and Rest.\n\n**Air** (refactor): Remove deprecated Mountain module from library exports.\n\n**Cocoon** (chore): Rebuild Target/ artifacts after RouteManifest regeneration.\n\n**Grove** (refactor): Consolidate Library.rs — remove API, Common, Services exports; keep Binary, DevLog, Host, Protocol, Transport, WASM.\n\n**Mountain** (chore): Revert Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json to standard binary names after Electron profile testing; remove duplicate Sky resource mappings; delete backup files; reset app identifier to fiddee.editor.binary.\n\n**Rest** (chore): Rebuild binary to incorporate upstream fixes.\n\nThis cleanup pass streamlines module trees and synchronizes compiled artifacts.",
